## Expected Result
- The exported component accepts and processes intents from any app on the device
- No permission check prevents unauthorized access
- Sensitive functionality or data is accessible without authentication

## Impact
{% if "CWE-926" in cwe %}
Any malicious app installed on the same device can interact with this exported component without any permission restrictions. This could allow unauthorized access to sensitive features, data theft, or privilege escalation.
{% elif "CWE-927" in cwe %}
The PendingIntent created by this component lacks FLAG_IMMUTABLE, allowing a receiving app to modify the intent's action, data, or extras. This can be exploited for privilege escalation or redirecting sensitive operations.
{% else %}
Unauthorized access to the exported component can lead to data leakage, privilege escalation, or denial of service.
{% endif %}

## Remediation
{{ remediation or "1. Set `android:exported=\"false\"` if the component doesn't need external access\n2. Add `android:permission` attribute with a custom signature-level permission\n3. Validate all incoming intent data and extras\n4. Use `PendingIntent.FLAG_IMMUTABLE` for all PendingIntents\n5. Implement runtime permission checks with `checkCallingPermission()`" }}
